LICENSE — TBD

The license that will govern released LUMINA model weights has not
yet been finalized by Argonne National Laboratory. Do not assume any
particular license terms from the presence of this placeholder.

To override this placeholder when staging a release, pass an explicit
path via:

    lumina-upload ... --license-path /path/to/your/LICENSE

or, programmatically:

    HFUploader(repo_id=..., license_path=Path("/path/to/your/LICENSE"))

Until the license is settled, treat the released artifacts as
"all rights reserved" by UChicago Argonne, LLC. This file will be
replaced once the final license has been approved.

Copyright (c) 2026, UChicago Argonne, LLC. All rights reserved.
